  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When the audit-triplestore Camel workflow is run (either as a webapp deployed in tomcat or using mvn jetty:run), when it attempts to process events, it gets the error:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java.lang.NoClassDefFoundError: Could not initialize class org.fcrepo.audit.InternalAuditor",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The fcrepo-audit JAR file is present in the audit-triplestore WAR file.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
